            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I can not reproduce this neither on Neovim 0.9.1 nor on the latest Nightly (`NVIM v0.10.0-dev-569+gfa0a25dcb`). It also passes designated tests for unfolding and centering both locally and on GitHub actions. It also works for me both with my normal configuration and with your example (with added `vim.o.foldmethod = 'indent'` line).\r\n\r\nCouple of questions:\r\n- Just to be safe, did you actually test this with the config you provided?\r\n- Are you sure, that `MiniMisc.setup_restore_cursor()` is actually executed prior you opening the file? It might happen if there is some lazy loading involved.\r\n- Are you sure, that folds are closed prior to opening file?",
